{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Multiply Fun》把九九乘法表的練習變成太空主題的互動遊戲，透過動畫與即時回饋，幫助正在學習乘法的兒童建立計算信心與速度，適合在家、學校或外出時使用。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-101.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>太空遊戲中練熟乘法</h2>\n<p>每次作答都會即時顯示對錯，並記錄每題所花時間。孩子可選擇語音作答，說出答案即可完成練習。系統會把答錯的題目重新安排，讓孩子反覆練習至熟練；互動算盤逐粒珠展示乘法累加過程，太空遊戲則要擊中正確答案的隕石。家長亦可列印 PDF 練習紙，在紙上離線練習。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-342-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-343-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-344-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-345-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-346-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-347-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Multiply Fun: 9×9</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/multiply-fun-9x9/id6737981759?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T01:41:07.709590+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T01:36:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T03:58:40.873101+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T01:38:26.193328+00:00","content_hash":"3cff82dd7d46e00364d5c446066d187b886210cf57b4681fe3b584d511e877ca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}